<Folder>
<name>🔵 Baignade</name>
<Placemark><name>Calanques d'Esparron</name><styleUrl>#baignade</styleUrl><description>Criques turquoise, 10 min à pied. LE spot. Masque/tuba.</description><Point><coordinates>5.9632,43.7263</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Plage de Carajuan</name><styleUrl>#baignade</styleUrl><description>Rivière au camping. Lâchers EDF à vérifier !</description><Point><coordinates>6.4375,43.7953</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Vasques du pont de Tusset</name><styleUrl>#baignade</styleUrl><description>Pont XVIIe + vasques. 15 min du parking Samson.</description><Point><coordinates>6.4150,43.7940</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Criques de Sainte-Croix-du-Verdon</name><styleUrl>#baignade</styleUrl><description>Sous le village, méconnues.</description><Point><coordinates>6.1509,43.7657</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Plage de Bauduen</name><styleUrl>#baignade</styleUrl><description>Galets blancs, sauts de rochers. Viser 15h+.</description><Point><coordinates>6.1772,43.7316</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Plage du Galetas</name><styleUrl>#baignade</styleUrl><description>Carte postale. Avant 9h30 ou après 17h30 SEULEMENT.</description><Point><coordinates>6.2495,43.8017</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Lac de Montpezat</name><styleUrl>#baignade</styleUrl><description>Récompense de la rando Baudinard.</description><Point><coordinates>6.0700,43.7050</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Lac d'Artignosc</name><styleUrl>#baignade</styleUrl><description>Plan B calme, base nautique.</description><Point><coordinates>6.0855,43.7030</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>

<Folder>
<name>🟤 Randos</name>
<Placemark><name>Couloir Samson (départ Point Sublime)</name><styleUrl>#rando</styleUrl><description>2h AR facile. LAMPE pour les tunnels.</description><Point><coordinates>6.3981,43.7935</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Cascades de Saint-Maurin</name><styleUrl>#rando</styleUrl><description>1h30. Cascades de tuf + grottes. Baignade interdite.</description><Point><coordinates>6.2905,43.7995</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Garde-canal (départ Musée Quinson)</name><styleUrl>#rando</styleUrl><description>10 km, 3h. N°1 AllTrails du parc. Lampe.</description><Point><coordinates>6.0397,43.6947</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Canyon de Baudinard (départ Montmeyan-plage)</name><styleUrl>#rando</styleUrl><description>2h30-3h. Massif Var : GO/NO-GO le matin.</description><Point><coordinates>6.0530,43.6880</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Tour du village de Moustiers</name><styleUrl>#rando</styleUrl><description>1h. Chapelle + vue lac.</description><Point><coordinates>6.2215,43.8457</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Gorges de Trévans (bonus)</name><styleUrl>#rando</styleUrl><description>Plan anti-feu/anti-foule, 40 min au nord.</description><Point><coordinates>6.1900,44.0000</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>

<Folder>
