<Placemark><name>Les Roches, Ste-Croix (nuit 3 alt.)</name><styleUrl>#camping</styleUrl><description>Municipal vue lac. 04 92 77 78 99</description><Point><coordinates>6.1509,43.7670</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
