<Placemark><name>Campings Esparron/Quinson (nuit 4 opt.)</name><styleUrl>#camping</styleUrl><description>Appeler 2-3 j avant.</description><Point><coordinates>5.9632,43.7270</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>

